            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.43

- Runs adjacent-track inspection inside YouTube Music's page execution context.
- Bridges queue results back safely through a temporary DOM attribute.
- Unlocks page-owned movie-player and queue-store APIs that Chrome Apple Events isolates.
- Retains the ordinary DOM fallback and keeps playback detection unchanged.
]]></description>
